====================================================================
DATA LICENSING NOTICE
====================================================================
This repository contains ANALYSIS CODE AND DERIVED OUTPUTS ONLY.

The bibliographic records analysed in the associated study were retrieved
from Scopus and are NOT redistributed here, in whole or in part, in
accordance with the Scopus Terms of Use. No bibliographic record text
(titles, abstracts, author keywords, affiliations, or full records) is
included in this repository.

Three inputs are withheld that would otherwise be needed to rerun the
pipeline:

    corpus.json          consolidated corpus, contains abstracts
    network_edges.csv    concept co-occurrence edge list
    pillar_of.json       concept-to-domain label map

All three are produced by the companion repository
(https://github.com/mahsatorabi/high-performance-sport-concept-network).
Regenerate them by running that repository's scripts/run_all.py.

Reproduce the corpus from scratch using the query and retrieval date
recorded in docs/scopus_query.md.

Document-concept matrices and concept embeddings (*.npy) are likewise
withheld: they are numeric transforms of record text.

Derived outputs (result tables, figures, and the verification report) are
released under CC BY 4.0.
====================================================================